  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 30 + 3 × 990 − 11 ÷ 63 = 237\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nOption 1) × and +\n\n30 + 3 × 990 − 11 ÷ 63 = 237 ⇒ 30 × 3 + 990 − 11 ÷ 63 = 237\n\n⇒ 30 × 3 + 990 − __**11 ÷ 63**__ = 237\n\n⇒ __**30 ×**____** 3**__ + 990 − 0.17 = 237\n\n⇒ __90** + 990**__ − 0.17 = 237\n\n⇒ **__1080__**__** − 0.17**__ = 237\n\n⇒ 1079.83 ≠ 237 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ and -\n\n30 + 3 × 990 − 11 ÷ 63 = 237 ⇒ 30 + 3 × 990 ÷ 11 - 63 = 237\n\n⇒ 30 + 3 × __**990 **____**÷**____** 11**__ - 63 = 237\n\n⇒ 30 + __**3 × 90**__ - 63 = 237\n\n⇒ __**30 + **270__ - 63 = 237\n\n⇒ __300____ - **63**__ = 237\n\n⇒ 237 = 237 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) - and ×\n\n30 + 3 × 990 − 11 ÷ 63 = 237 ⇒ 30 + 3 - 990 × 11 ÷ 63 = 237\n\n⇒ 30 + 3 - 990 × __**11 ÷ 63**__ = 237\n\n⇒ 30 + 3 - __**990 **____**×**____** 0.17**__ = 237\n\n⇒ __**30 + 3**__ - 168.3 = 237\n\n⇒ __33** - 168.3**__ = 237\n\n⇒ -135.3 ≠ 237 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and -\n\n30 + 3 × 990 − 11 ÷ 63 = 237 ⇒ 30 - 3 × 990 + 11 ÷ 63 = 237\n\n⇒ 30 - 3 × 990 + __**11 ÷ 63**__ = 237\n\n⇒ 30 - __**3 × 990**__ + 0.17 = 237\n\n⇒ __**30 + 0.17**__ - 2970 = 237\n\n⇒ __30.17** - 2970**__ = 237\n\n⇒ -2939.83 ≠ 237 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
